    "Name": "Ifrit",
    "Details": "Asfeh means 'Sandstorm' in Arabic. The Ifrit VTOL Strike Craft was designed to intercept and delay armored advances. Reactive armor, a Jet Booster and AMS boost survivability. The Asfeh bears RISC's experimental Micro Missile System, along with advanced air-to-air Arrow IV wingmounts.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Reactive Plating\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       150     20\n<b>Left</b>         115     20\n<b>Right</b>       115     20\n<b>Rear</b>        100     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      500    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Quick Off The Line</color>",
